{"id": "DecCIOIAmhs", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "How does Zomato find your delivery partner so fast? 🛵\n\nIt doesn't search every rider in the city. It looks only in the map cells around the restaurant (geospatial indexing), checks who's online, who's busy and who can get there fastest, ranks them, sends an offer — and retries if the rider declines.\n\nOne simple food order = a real-time distributed systems problem.\n\n📌 Save this for your next system design interview\n👉 Follow @teksimplified for more tech breakdowns\n\n#systemdesign #zomato #backenddevelopment #softwareengineering #techinhindi", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1791902072, "like_count": 6, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18139738648575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 57.523, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQORrkUZrUruUf2TfjA8dmv4lrO22mOqghVP-7lm1-QnwDzEagAyAOk_pHdtbP5FtNYXu32tBIOJU8Vgf3D1S9kk8l0guarYyKzU4sI.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=AdqHJEvt_9ZV8snpfEdEedZttYOjzPLNCKU_jWoNKf5P_Cuzb99KLZpnlBPS4h4sTNl2ktkc-EYnJ3u6CuuNMm2k&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=LQWjJMW2PHYQ7kNvwG1Lqd-&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=DdYX2RzMfHWLVpNnKRYE6Q&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRgjeKJa-Q_p1w9WAXnDzNVk1hxJLolaagOEsTXFBTaTQ&oe=6AF4340D", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 57.523, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fet